  "prefLabel": "He-C 6349.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6349.02 Scope. This part shall apply to licensed and licensed exempt child care service providers who receive financial reimbursement from the department of health and human services (DHHS) for services provided to children and families.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6349) #9268, eff 9-20-08; ss by #11166, INTERIM, eff 9-19-16, EXPIRED: 3-18-17",
